# Product-naming allowlist. Format: path-glob<TAB>regex
# Approved customer-facing name: Metrum AI Bench CLI.
# Binary/crate names remain metrum-ai-bench-cli.
.gitignore	metrumbench-imagegen-artifacts
scripts/live/**	metrumbench
TRADEMARKS.md	^\*\*Forbidden\*\* \(non-exhaustive\): `MetrumBench`, `Insights CLI`, `Bench by Metrum`\.$
docs/NAMING.md	^\| Formal \| `Metrum AI Bench CLI` \| `MetrumBench`, `Insights CLI`, `Bench by Metrum` \|$
docs/NAMING.md	^\| Binary \| `metrum-ai-bench-cli\*` \| `metrumbench`, pre-1\.2\.0 `metrum-ai-bench\*` without `-cli` \|$
docs/NAMING.md	As of \*\*1\.3\.0\*\*|pre-1\.2\.0 `metrum-ai-bench\*` shim|`metrumbench-\*`
src/record.rs	metrum-ai-bench\.(request|summary)\.v
README.md	pre-1\.2\.0 `metrum-ai-bench\*`|`metrumbench-\*`
docs/**	metrumbench-\*|pre-1\.2\.0|metrum-ai-bench\*|removed in 1\.3\.0|removed in v2\.0
external-docs/**	metrumbench-\*|pre-1\.2\.0|metrum-ai-bench\*|removed in 1\.3\.0|yanked
CHANGELOG.md	metrum-ai-bench|metrumbench|Homebrew
